   "description": "The public API has no limit per key. On Nov 3 one customer\u2019s import script took the read replicas down.\n\n**What we want**\n\n- A limit per API key, 600 requests a minute unless the plan says more\n- `429` with a `Retry-After` header\n- The limit shown on the usage page (ACM-371)\n",
